## Why This Is Asked
Assess ability to combine REST, WebSocket, Service Worker, and DOM efficiently for real-time UIs with offline support.

## Key Concepts
- DOM updates keyed by id
- WebSocket message handling
- Service Worker caching of API responses
- Fetch error handling and retry/backoff
